1978, "y0": 0.3162393162393162, "x1": 0.14175824175824175, "y1": 0.3278943278943279}, {"text": "Infantile, idiotically comic yet strangely moving.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.5615384615384615, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "To what extent does this view align with your understanding of Under Milk Wood?", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.3822843822843823, "x1": 0.8417582417582418, "y1": 0.3954933954933955}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.4156954156954157, "x1": 0.6758241758241759, "y1": 0.4289044289044289}, {"text": "Question 5 \u2014 Nonfiction (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4825174825174825, "x1": 0.42637362637362636, "y1": 0.494949494949495}, {"text": "Edmund de Waal, The Hare with Amber Eyes", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.515928515928516, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.5291375291375291}, {"text": "(a)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5167055167055167, "x1": 0.14065934065934066, "y1": 0.5283605283605284}, {"text": "History provides the momentum, memoir the emotion.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5493395493395493, "x1": 0.6076923076923076, "y1": 0.5625485625485626}, {"text": "To what extent does this view align with your understanding of The Hare with Amber", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.581973581973582, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5951825951825952}, {"text": "Eyes?", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5998445998445998, "x1": 0.21318681318681318, "y1": 0.6122766122766122}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.6324786324786325, "x1": 0.6758241758241759, "y1": 0.6456876456876457}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.6744366744366744, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.6845376845376845}, {"text": "Vladimir Nabokov, Speak, Memory", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.7327117327117327, "x1": 0.46703296703296704, "y1":