: 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.32867132867132864}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.6285714285714286, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "Question 8 \u2014 Shakespearean Drama \u2014 William Shakespeare, King Henry IV, Part 1", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4149184149184149, "x1": 0.8395604395604396, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "(20 marks)", "x0": 0.24395604395604395, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.33076923076923076, "y1": 0.4444444444444444}, {"text": "Comedy steps into the path of history and is crushed.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.4654234654234654, "x1": 0.5494505494505495, "y1": 0.47863247863247865}, {"text": "To what extent does this view align with your understanding of King Henry IV, Part 1?", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.4988344988344988, "x1": 0.8296703296703297, "y1": 0.5120435120435121}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5322455322455323, "x1": 0.6285714285714286, "y1": 0.5454545454545454}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.589010989010989, "y1": 0.09712509712509712}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11732711732711733, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Attempt Question 9", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.14685314685314685}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.15073815073815075, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16083916083916083}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 18-24 of the Paper 2 Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "are available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.20046620046620048, "x1": 0.22527472527472528, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.23076923076923078, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "* craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "+ use language appropriate to audience, purpose and context to deliberately shape", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.27117327117327117, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "meaning", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2874902874902875, "x1": 0.23516483516483516, "y1": 0.3006993006993007}, {"text": "Question 9 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "Twice before, a book had turned him inside out and altered who he", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.36596736596736595, "x1": 0.7846153846153846, "y1": 0.3776223776223776}, {"text": ": Paul Auster, 2017", "x0": 0.4956043956043956, "y0": 0.3776223776223776, "x1": 0.9318681318681319, "y1": 0.3853923853923854}, {"text": "was, had blasted apart his assumptions about the world and thrust him [seu win permission", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.9527472527472527, "y1": 0.3986013986013986}, {"text": "onto a new ground where everything in the world suddenly looked the author,", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.40015540015540013, "x1": 0.9197802197802197, "y1": 0.4125874125874126}, {"text": "different \u2014 and would remain different for the rest of time, for as long Agency", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.41181041181041184, "x1": 0.9439560439560439, "y1": 0.43434343434343436}, {"text": "as he himself went on living in time and occupied space in the world.", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.7769230769230769, "y1": 0.445998445998446}, {"text": "PAaUuL AuSTER, 4321", "x0": 0.6076923076923076, "y0": 0.45843045843045843, "x1": 0.7835164835164835, "y1": 0.4693084693084693}, {"text": "(a) Continue this extract as a piece of imaginative, discursive or persuasive writing 10", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.49106449106449107, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5042735042735043}, {"text": "that evokes a particular emotional response in the reader.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5042735042735043, "x1": 0.6285714285714286, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "Note: You are NOT required to write out the extract as part of your response.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5407925407925408, "x1": 0.7945054945054945, "y1": 0.554001554001554}, {"text": "(b) Compare how you have used language in part (a) to evoke emotion with the way 10", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5742035742035742, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5874125874125874}, {"text": "writing has been crafted in at least ONE prescribed text from Module C.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.5912975912975913, "x1": 0.7527472527472527, "y1": 0.6045066045066045}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are listed on page 10.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.6410256410256411, "x1": 0.46153846153846156, "y1": 0.6542346542346542}, {"text": "Question 9 continues on page 10", "x0": 0.36043956043956044, "y0": 0.7078477078477079, "x1": 0.6384615384615384, "y1": 0.721056721056721}], [{"text": "Question 9 (continued)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11577311577311578, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.256043956043956, "y1": 0.1585081585081585}, {"text": "Kate Chopin, The Awakening", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.14918414918414918, "x1": 0.5472527472527473, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text